{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# Site-1 clean CG functionals for $[5,2,0]^{\\otimes 2}$ (generic in $\\Lambda$)\n\nThe same code as `Minimal-ingredients-510-EH.wb`, with $\\Lambda=[5,2,0]$ (dim 42, 1764 states). It is the site-1-only pipeline of `Minimal-ingredients-310-EH.wb` (Section 9), written generically in $\\Lambda$, and is self-contained: the first code cell clears the (shared) kernel. **No site localization had been done for $[5,2,0]$ before this notebook.** Section 4's scan determines its site-1-local $T_\\lambda$. The nearest analogue is $[4,2,0]$: $T_{(1,1)},T_{(2,2)},T_{(3,2)},T_{(4,2)}$ at $\\theta_1-4h$.\n\n**Ingredients.** Only $\\langle\\Omega|\\Psi\\rangle$ and the site-1-local fused transfer matrices $T_\\lambda(\\theta_1+ch)$, as found by the scan.\n\n**Covectors.** For each insertion $X$, the covector in the frame with $R$ undone is $c_X=\\langle\\Omega|X\\,(R\\otimes R)^{-1}$, computed numerically from the operators. So **no prefactors $f_\\lambda$ are needed**: the Q-side number is $X^B\\langle\\Omega|\\Psi\\rangle$ itself. Section 4 reports the $f_\\lambda$ anyway, as a check of locality.\n\n**Method** (as in the $[3,1,0]$ and $[4,2,0]$ notebooks):\n- top-kill: $d_X=c_X-(c_X\\cdot e_1e_1)\\,e_1e_1$;\n- split each $d_X$ into signal $S=d\\cdot P_{\\rm HW}\\Psi$ and contamination $K=d\\cdot(R\\otimes R)\\Psi_\\perp$;\n- check that the leading $K/S$ ratios are structural ($\\varphi,\\omega$-independent);\n- the clean space of a weight sector is the null space of its copies' contamination vectors; where it lacks HW rank, clean each copy separately;\n- fair test: fit the clean spaces at $(\\varepsilon=10^{-5},\\varphi,\\omega)$, then recover $P_{\\rm HW}\\Psi$ (scale included) by least squares over five $w$ at $(10^{-4},\\varphi)$ and $(10^{-5},\\varphi')$;\n- Section 6b refits at $10^{-6}$ and tests at $(10^{-6},\\varphi')$ to confirm $O(\\varepsilon)$ convergence.\n\nConventions: $\\mathcal L_{ij}=(u-\\theta_s)\\delta_{ij}+hE_{ij}$, twist on the right, EH generators, CBR fusion $T_\\lambda(u)=\\det_{i,j}t_{\\lambda'_j+i-j}(u+(i-1)h)$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* fresh kernel: clears Global` for every notebook sharing this kernel (their files are untouched) *)\nClearAll @@ Select[Names[\"Global`*\"], FreeQ[Attributes[#], Protected] &];\n(* GT basis and gl(3) generators, verbatim from the clean L=1 notebook *)\nps[rep_] := ps[rep] = Block[{res = (Prepend[rep, #1] &) /@ Tuples[Table[Range[rep[[1, i + 1]], rep[[1, i]]], {i, 1, Length[rep[[1]]] - 1}]]}, If[Length[res[[1, 1]]] == 1, Reverse[Sort[res]], Reverse[Sort[Flatten[ps /@ res, 1]]]]];\ndim[rep_] := dim[rep] = Length[ps[{rep}]];\nJ0[k_][pat_] := J0[k][pat] = Sum[pat[[k, i]], {i, 1, k}] - Sum[pat[[k - 1, i]], {i, 1, k - 1}];\nJp[k_][pat_] := Jp[k][pat] = -Sum[(Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k + 1, j]] + j, {j, Range[k + 1]}]/Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}])*v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] + 1]], {i, 1, k}];\nJm[k_][pat_] := Jm[k][pat] = Sum[(Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k - 1, j]] + j, {j, Range[k - 1]}]/Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}])*v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] - 1]], {i, 1, k}];\nJJ[k_, l_, rep_] := JJ[k, l, rep] = Which[\n  k == l, DiagonalMatrix[J0[k] /@ ps[{rep}]],\n  l == k + 1, Transpose[Table[(Coefficient[Jp[k][ps[{rep}][[i]]], v[#1]] &) /@ ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]],\n  l == k - 1, Transpose[Table[(Coefficient[Jm[l][ps[{rep}][[i]]], v[#1]] &) /@ ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]],\n  l > k + 1, JJ[k, k + 1, rep] . JJ[k + 1, l, rep] - JJ[k + 1, l, rep] . JJ[k, k + 1, rep],\n  l < k - 1, JJ[k, k - 1, rep] . JJ[k - 1, l, rep] - JJ[k - 1, l, rep] . JJ[k, k - 1, rep]];\n(* ---- the rep ---- *)\nΛ = {5, 2, 0};\nd1 = dim[Λ]; d2 = d1^2; id1 = IdentityMatrix[d1]; idm2 = IdentityMatrix[d2, SparseArray]; pr = 300;\nhN = 1/2; thN = {2/7, -3/5}; θ12 = thN[[1]] - thN[[2]];\n(* Hermitian generators EH = Rd.E.Rd^-1 with EH^T = EH_ji; Rd is diagonal, unrelated to the rotation R *)\nMsolEH = Module[{Mv = Array[mm, d1]}, Mv /. First[Solve[Join[Thread[DeleteCases[Union[Flatten[Table[DiagonalMatrix[Mv] . JJ[j, i, Λ] - Transpose[JJ[i, j, Λ]] . DiagonalMatrix[Mv], {i, 3}, {j, 3}]]], 0] == 0], {mm[1] == 1}], Mv]]];\nRd = Sqrt[MsolEH];\nEe[i_, j_] := Ee[i, j] = DiagonalMatrix[Rd] . JJ[i, j, Λ] . DiagonalMatrix[1/Rd];\nEN[i_, j_] := EN[i, j] = N[Ee[i, j], pr];\nEtotN[i_, j_] := EtotN[i, j] = KroneckerProduct[SparseArray[EN[i, j]], SparseArray[id1]] + KroneckerProduct[SparseArray[id1], SparseArray[EN[i, j]]];\nzeroQ[e_] := AllTrue[Union[Flatten[{e}]], PossibleZeroQ];\nwtBasis = Flatten[Table[Table[J0[k][p1] + J0[k][p2], {k, 3}], {p1, ps[{Λ}]}, {p2, ps[{Λ}]}], 1];\nsecOf[μ_] := secOf[μ] = Flatten[Position[wtBasis, μ]];\nkron[a_, b_] := Flatten[KroneckerProduct[a, b]];\ne1 = UnitVector[d1, 1]; e11 = kron[e1, e1];\n(* exp of a nilpotent matrix: finite sum from the identity (MatrixPower[nilpotent, 0] errors) *)\nnexp[A_] := id1 + Sum[MatrixPower[A, k]/k!, {k, 1, 2 (Λ[[1]] - Λ[[3]])}];\n(* (g⊗g).v and c.(g⊗g) without forming the d2×d2 Kronecker product *)\nactRR[g_, v_] := Flatten[g . Partition[v, d1] . Transpose[g]];\ncovRR[c_, g_] := Flatten[Transpose[g] . Partition[c, d1] . g];\nGrid[{{\"Λ\", Λ}, {\"one-site, two-site dimension\", {d1, d2}}, {\"precision\", pr}, {\"EH^T = EH_ji\", And @@ Flatten[Table[zeroQ[Transpose[Ee[i, j]] - Ee[j, i]], {i, 3}, {j, 3}]]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"485294\" data-output-id=\"41\" data-out-n=\"572\" data-sub-idx=\"29\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"1\" data-sub-start=\"34\" data-sub-end=\"34\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[572]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"XGJlZ2lue2FycmF5fXt8Y3xjfH1caGxpbmVcTGFtYmRhICAmIFxsZWZ0XHs1LDIsMFxyaWdodFx9XFxcaGxpbmVcdGV4dHtvbmUtc2l0ZSwgdHdvLXNpdGUgZGltZW5zaW9ufSAmIFxsZWZ0XHs0MiwxNzY0XHJpZ2h0XH1cXFxobGluZVx0ZXh0e3ByZWNpc2lvbn0gJiAzMDBcXFxobGluZVx0ZXh0e0VIXF57fVQgPSBFSFxfaml9ICYgXG1hdGhybXtUcnVlfVxcXGhsaW5lXGVuZHthcnJheX0=\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:4.84em;vertical-align:-2.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.65em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:4.8em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.15em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.65em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Λ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">one-site, two-site dimension</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">precision</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">EH</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">T = EH_ji</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:4.8em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.15em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.65em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">42</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1764</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">300</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:4.8em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.15em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
