  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 3. Eigenstates at small twist and the highest-weight states\n$z=e^{\\varepsilon\\varphi}$, $w=e^{\\varepsilon\\omega}$. For each dominant weight $\\mu$, `hwB[μ]` is an orthonormal basis of the untwisted HW vectors (killed by the total $E_{12},E_{23}$); its length is the multiplicity. States: eigenvectors of $t_1+\\pi t_2$ at $u=3/7$ in each HW weight sector, normalized $\\langle x_0|\\Psi\\rangle=1$. HW-limit states have $\\|P_{\\rm HW}\\Psi\\|/\\|\\Psi\\|\\to1$; within a weight, copies are ordered by the eigenvalue.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "φ = {1/3, -2/7, 5/11}; φp = {-2/5, 3/8, 7/11}; ω = {3/4, -1/5, 2/9};\nzOf[ε_, φv_] := N[Exp[ε φv], pr]; wOf[ε_, ωv_] := N[Exp[ε ωv], pr];\nhwB[μ_] := hwB[μ] = With[{sec = secOf[μ]}, With[{ns = NullSpace[Normal[Join[EtotN[1, 2][[All, sec]], EtotN[2, 3][[All, sec]]]]]}, If[ns === {}, {}, Orthogonalize[Table[Normal[SparseArray[Thread[sec -> n], {d2}]], {n, ns}]]]]];\nprojHW[μ_, v_] := If[hwB[μ] === {}, 0 v, (hwB[μ] . v) . hwB[μ]];\nhwSecs = Select[Reverse[Sort[Select[Union[wtBasis], #[[1]] >= #[[2]] >= #[[3]] &]]], Length[hwB[#]] > 0 &];\nhwList = Flatten[Table[{μ, k}, {μ, hwSecs}, {k, Length[hwB[μ]]}], 1];\nstatesAt[zv_] := statesAt[zv] = Module[{mix = tL2[1, 3/7, DiagonalMatrix[zv]] + N[Pi, pr] tL2[2, 3/7, DiagonalMatrix[zv]], x = x0[zv]},\n   Flatten[Table[With[{sec = secOf[μ]}, With[{es = Eigensystem[Normal[mix[[sec, sec]]]]}, Table[With[{ψ = Normal[SparseArray[Thread[sec -> es[[2, k]]], {d2}]]}, With[{Ψ = ψ/(x . ψ)},\n          <|\"mu\" -> μ, \"ev\" -> es[[1, k]], \"psi\" -> Ψ, \"hwFrac\" -> Norm[projHW[μ, Ψ]]/Norm[Ψ]|>]], {k, Length[sec]}]]], {μ, hwSecs}], 1]];\nhwStates[zv_] := Select[statesAt[zv], #[\"hwFrac\"] > 9/10 &];\npickState[μ_, copy_, zv_] := SortBy[Select[hwStates[zv], #[\"mu\"] === μ &], Re[#[\"ev\"]] &][[copy]];\n{tS, sts} = AbsoluteTiming[statesAt[zOf[10^-3, φ]]];\nGrid[Join[{{\"μ\", \"dim weight space\", \"HW multiplicity\", \"HW-limit states found\", \"largest ‖P_HW Ψ‖/‖Ψ‖ (ε = 10^-3)\"}},\n   Table[With[{s = Select[sts, #[\"mu\"] === μ &]}, {μ, Length[secOf[μ]], Length[hwB[μ]], Count[s, x_ /; x[\"hwFrac\"] > 9/10], N[Take[Reverse[Sort[s[[All, \"hwFrac\"]]]], UpTo[Length[hwB[μ]] + 1]], 4]}], {μ, hwSecs}],\n   {{\"time (s)\", tS, \"\", \"\", \"\"}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
