  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 4. Which $T_\\lambda$ are site-1 local? An independent scan\nFor every CBR shape $\\lambda$ with $\\lambda_1\\le\\Lambda_1$ and $\\lambda_3=0$, and every shift $u=\\theta_1+ch$ with $c=-\\Lambda_1-2,\\dots,1$, compute $C=\\langle\\Omega|T_\\lambda(u)$ at the finite test twist, acting factor by factor on the covector. Reshape $C$ as a $d\\times d$ matrix whose rows are site 1:\n- **site-1 local** means $C=v\\,\\Omega_{zw}^T$;\n- **nontrivial** means $v\\not\\parallel\\Omega_{zw}$;\n- **eigen** means $C\\propto\\Omega$.\n\nThe nontrivial site-1 hits become the insertions `locShapes` at `uLoc`. For each, the prefactor $f_\\lambda$ in $\\langle\\Omega|T_\\lambda=f_\\lambda\\,\\langle\\Omega_{zw}|T^{L=1,\\theta_1}_\\lambda\\otimes\\langle\\Omega_{zw}|$ is fitted at the test twist. It is only a check, since the pipeline uses the covectors directly.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ⟨Ω| T_λ(x) as a covector: CBR permutation sum, applied factor by factor to the covector *)\ntApply[cv_, a_, x_, Z_] := Which[a == 0, cv, a == 3, qdetS[Diagonal[Z], x] cv, True, cv . tL2[a, x, Z]];\ncovT[λ_, x_, Z_, c0_] := With[{lc = conj[λ], n = Max[λ]}, Sum[With[{as = Table[lc[[σ[[i]]]] + i - σ[[i]], {i, n}]},\n     If[Min[as] < 0 || Max[as] > 3, 0 c0, Signature[σ] Fold[tApply[#1, #2[[1]], #2[[2]], Z] &, c0, Table[{as[[i]], x + (i - 1) hN}, {i, n}]]]], {σ, Permutations[Range[n]]}]];\nlocClass[cv_, o_] := Module[{C = Partition[cv, d1], v, r1, r2, rEig},\n   If[maxAbs[cv] == 0, Return[\"zero\"]];\n   v = C . o/(o . o); r1 = Norm[Flatten[C - Outer[Times, v, o]]]/Norm[Flatten[C]];\n   r2 = Norm[Flatten[C - Outer[Times, o, o . C/(o . o)]]]/Norm[Flatten[C]];\n   rEig = Norm[v - (v . o/(o . o)) o]/Norm[v];\n   Which[r1 < 10^-60 && rEig < 10^-60, \"eigen\", r1 < 10^-60, \"SITE 1\", r2 < 10^-60, \"site 2\", True, \"·\"]];\nshapesScan = Flatten[Table[If[b == 0, {a}, {a, b}], {a, 1, Λ[[1]]}, {b, 0, a}], 1];\ncScan = Range[-Λ[[1]] - 2, 1];\n{tScan, scan} = AbsoluteTiming[With[{o = Om1[zT, wT], c0 = Om2[zT, wT], Z = DiagonalMatrix[zT]},\n    Table[locClass[covT[λ, thN[[1]] + cc hN, Z, c0], o], {λ, shapesScan}, {cc, cScan}]]];\nhits = Select[Flatten[Table[{shapesScan[[i]], cScan[[j]], scan[[i, j]]}, {i, Length[shapesScan]}, {j, Length[cScan]}], 1], #[[3]] === \"SITE 1\" &];\n(* the insertions: all nontrivial site-1 hits, which must share one shift *)\ncLoc = If[Length[Union[hits[[All, 2]]]] == 1, hits[[1, 2]], $Failed];\nlocShapes = hits[[All, 1]]; nL = Length[locShapes]; uLoc = thN[[1]] + cLoc hN;\n(* fitted prefactors f_λ at the test twist, with the residual of the factorized form *)\nfFit = Table[With[{cv = covT[λ, uLoc, DiagonalMatrix[zT], Om2[zT, wT]], fac = kron[Om1[zT, wT] . TL1[1, λ, uLoc, DiagonalMatrix[zT]], Om1[zT, wT]]},\n     With[{f = (Conjugate[fac] . cv)/(Conjugate[fac] . fac)}, {λ, f, maxAbs[cv - f fac]/maxAbs[cv]}]], {λ, locShapes}];\nColumn[{Grid[Join[{Prepend[(\"c = \" <> ToString[#] &) /@ cScan, \"λ \\\\ u = θ1 + c h\"]}, MapThread[Prepend, {scan, ToString /@ shapesScan}]], Frame -> All],\n  Grid[Join[{{\"nontrivial site-1 hits {λ, c}\", hits[[All, 1 ;; 2]], \"\"}, {\"λ\", \"fitted f_λ (test twist)\", \"rel. residual of factorized form\"}}, Map[N[#, 8] &, fFit, {2}], {{\"time (s)\", tScan, \"\"}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
