  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 4b. Closed forms of the $f_\\lambda$ (a check only)\nThe ansatz is $f_\\lambda=\\pm\\prod_{k=0}^{6}(\\theta_{12}-kh)^{n_k}$ with $n_k\\in\\{0,\\dots,3\\}$. It is fitted at P1 (exact match of the rationalized $f$), and the fitted form is then tested at a second chain point P2 $=(h,\\theta)=(1/3,\\{3/11,-4/7\\})$. Only the covector at P2 is recomputed, with its own $\\Omega$ and test twist.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "fAnsatz[n_, th12_, h_] := Product[(th12 - k h)^n[[k + 1]], {k, 0, 6}];\nfitF[fval_] := Module[{fr = Rationalize[fval, 10^-150], cands}, cands = Select[Tuples[Range[0, 3], 7], Abs[fr] == Abs[fAnsatz[#, θ12, hN]] &]; {Sign[fr/fAnsatz[First[cands], θ12, hN]], cands}];\nfForms = Table[fitF[f[[2]]], {f, fFit}];\n(* second chain point: redo the factorization residual with the fitted form, then restore P1 *)\nfAtP2 = Block[{hN = 1/3, thN = {3/11, -4/7}}, Module[{th12 = thN[[1]] - thN[[2]], u = thN[[1]] + cLoc hN},\n    ClearAll[tL2, lax2]; tL2[a_, x_, M_] := tL2[a, x, M] = tq[mono2[M], a, x]; lax2[x_] := lax2[x] = With[{L1 = lax1[1, x], L2 = lax1[2, x]}, Table[Sum[KroneckerProduct[SparseArray[L1[[i, k]]], SparseArray[L2[[k, j]]]], {k, 3}], {i, 3}, {j, 3}]];\n    Table[With[{cv = covT[locShapes[[j]], u, DiagonalMatrix[zT], Om2[zT, wT]], fac = kron[Om1[zT, wT] . TL1[1, locShapes[[j]], u, DiagonalMatrix[zT]], Om1[zT, wT]], fP = fForms[[j, 1]] fAnsatz[fForms[[j, 2, 1]], th12, hN]},\n      maxAbs[cv - fP fac]/maxAbs[cv]], {j, nL}]]];\nClearAll[tL2, lax2]; tL2[a_, x_, M_] := tL2[a, x, M] = tq[mono2[M], a, x]; lax2[x_] := lax2[x] = With[{L1 = lax1[1, x], L2 = lax1[2, x]}, Table[Sum[KroneckerProduct[SparseArray[L1[[i, k]]], SparseArray[L2[[k, j]]]], {k, 3}], {i, 3}, {j, 3}]];\nfText[sgn_, n_] := Row[{If[sgn < 0, \"−\", \"\"], Row[Table[If[n[[k + 1]] == 0, Nothing, Row[{\"(θ12−\", k, \"h)\", If[n[[k + 1]] > 1, Superscript[\"\", n[[k + 1]]], \"\"]}]], {k, 0, 6}]]}];\nGrid[Join[{{\"λ\", \"f_λ (fitted at P1)\", \"# matching ansatz forms\", \"rel. residual of factorized form at P2\"}},\n   Table[{locShapes[[j]], fText[fForms[[j, 1]], fForms[[j, 2, 1]]], Length[fForms[[j, 2]]], N[fAtP2[[j]], 3]}, {j, nL}]], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
