  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 6b. Convergence check: refit the clean spaces at $\\varepsilon=10^{-6}$\nSection 6 fits at $10^{-5}$. Some errors at the $(10^{-5},\\varphi')$ test point stall at $\\sim10^{-4.2}$–$10^{-5.5}$ instead of dropping a decade. If that comes from $O(\\varepsilon_{\\rm fit})$ errors in the fitted clean coefficients, then refitting at $10^{-6}$ (same $\\varphi,\\omega$, same sector/per-copy choice) should bring the $(10^{-6},\\varphi')$ errors down to $\\sim10^{-6}$ or below.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "kVecE[μ_, c_, εf_] := kVecE[μ, c, εf] = normKS[KS[μ, c, εf, φ, ω], μ, c][[1]];\ncleanSecE[μ_, εf_] := nullOf[Table[kVecE[μ, c, εf], {c, Length[hwB[μ]]}]];\ncleanCopyE[μ_, c_, εf_] := nullOf[{kVecE[μ, c, εf]}];\n{t6b, tab6b} = AbsoluteTiming[Table[Module[{mult = Length[hwB[μ]], cs, rk, full},\n     cs = cleanSecE[μ, 10^-6]; rk = Take[hwRank[μ, cs, 10^-6], UpTo[mult + 1]];\n     full = Length[rk] >= mult && rk[[mult]] > 10^-3;\n     {μ, Table[With[{vs = If[full, cs, cleanCopyE[μ, c, 10^-6]]}, With[{r5 = reconV[μ, c, 10^-5, vs, φp], r6 = reconV[μ, c, 10^-6, vs, φp]},\n         {c, If[full, \"sector\", \"per copy\"], Round[Log10[r5[[1]]], 0.1], Round[Log10[r6[[1]]], 0.1], r6[[2]]}]], {c, mult}]}], {μ, Rest[hwSecs]}]];\nGrid[Join[{{\"μ\", \"per copy: {copy, space, log10 rel. err at (10^-5, φ'), at (10^-6, φ'), digits}\"}}, tab6b, {{\"time (s)\", t6b}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
