  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 6c. Weakly conditioned sectors: sector-wide vs per-copy cleaning\nIn a few sectors the sector clean space has full HW rank only barely (second relative singular value $\\sigma_2\\lesssim0.05$). There the error is $O(\\varepsilon)$ but amplified by roughly $1/\\sigma_2$. Per-copy clean spaces are larger, so they may be better conditioned. For every multiplicity sector with sector $\\sigma_{\\min}<0.05$, this compares the two choices, both fitted at $10^{-6}$ and tested at $(10^{-5},\\varphi')$ and $(10^{-6},\\varphi')$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "weakSecs = Select[tab6, #[[2]] > 1 && Length[#[[4]]] >= #[[2]] && 10^-3 < #[[4]][[#[[2]]]] < 1/20 &][[All, 1]];\n{t6c, tab6c} = AbsoluteTiming[Table[Table[With[{vsS = cleanSecE[μ, 10^-6], vsC = cleanCopyE[μ, c, 10^-6]},\n      {μ, c, Round[N[Last[Take[hwRank[μ, vsS, 10^-6], UpTo[Length[hwB[μ]]]]]], 0.0001],\n       Round[Log10[reconV[μ, c, 10^-5, vsS, φp][[1]]], 0.1], Round[Log10[reconV[μ, c, 10^-6, vsS, φp][[1]]], 0.1],\n       Round[Log10[reconV[μ, c, 10^-5, vsC, φp][[1]]], 0.1], Round[Log10[reconV[μ, c, 10^-6, vsC, φp][[1]]], 0.1]}], {c, Length[hwB[μ]]}], {μ, weakSecs}]];\nGrid[Join[{{\"μ\", \"copy\", \"sector σ_min\", \"sector: log10 err (10^-5, φ')\", \"(10^-6, φ')\", \"per copy: log10 err (10^-5, φ')\", \"(10^-6, φ')\"}}, Flatten[tab6c, 1], {{\"time (s)\", t6c, \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
